---
/**
 * Closing call to action, as a bento: a wide statement tile carrying the ask,
 * with the contact route and the resume as two smaller tiles beside it.
 */
---

<footer class="page-shell pb-20">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="bento-tile surface-strong gap-6 sm:p-10 lg:col-span-8">
      <span class="chat-icon" role="img" aria-label="Let's connect"></span>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <p class="section-label">Start a conversation</p>
        <h3 class="hero-title text-3xl text-balance text-foreground sm:text-4xl">
          Have something complex that needs to ship?
        </h3>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm text-muted sm:text-base">
          I take on interface architecture, design systems, and front-end builds — usually where
          the problem is tangled and the team wants one person who can do the thinking and the
          building. Tell me what is broken.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-4 lg:grid-cols-1">
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="bento-tile card-lift justify-between gap-6 bg-accent text-[color:var(--on-accent)]"
      >
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] opacity-90">Contact</span>
        <span class="hero-title text-2xl">Start a conversation →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/resume" class="bento-tile surface card-lift justify-between gap-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-subtle">Resume</span>
        <span class="hero-title text-2xl text-foreground">Read the resume →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
